<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:section_3> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Introductory text: the Worcester F51/F52 series flanged ball valve is standardized in design, materials and construction for worldwide availability and shorter lead times, with interchangeable parts available in all regions and support from Quick Response Centers (QRCs)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Designed for global availability and lower total costs" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers general questions about the valve's standardization, availability and service support."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:section_4> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Short text on reliability and safety: bubble-tight shutoff, a live-loaded packing design against fugitive emissions and a threaded end plug design that ensures positive retention and eliminates blowout risk."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Standardized for reliability, compliance and safety" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers questions about the valve's shutoff, packing and blowout-safety design."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:section_40> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Product code position 14 (special: consult factory) with the product code notes: gearbox standard for DN150 (NPS 6) and larger, locking wrenches standard up to DN100 (NPS4), and footnotes (1) duplex stainless stem as standard, (2) some stem materials may not meet all of ISO 17292 or API 608, (3) no secondary stem seal for DN50 (NPS 2) and below, (4) consult factory for other configurations."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "14. Special" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the product code footnotes and which items are standard without being coded."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 11 .

