<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:section_6> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Numbered feature list belonging to the cutaway drawing: actuator mounting to ISO 5211 and Shell MESC SPE 77/300, anti-blowout duplex stainless steel stem, gland nut locking clip, live-loaded packing (API 641, ISO 15848), cavity pressure-relieving seat, PTFE body seals with fire-safe metal-to-metal secondary sealing, anti-static design, threaded insert, locking wrench through NPS 4 (DN100) and an optional O-ring stem seal."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Features and benefits" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the standard design features of the valve and the standards they conform to."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 3 .

plm:PCA_100003684 skos:exactMatch <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM> .

<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:table_azure_0> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "List of industries and typical applications of the F51/F52 valve in four columns: chemical processing (thermal fluids, oxygen services, ammonia, chlorine, hydrogen peroxide, phosgene), petrochemicals (BTX, ethylene, polyolefins/aromatics), energy (gasification, hydrogen, LNG, steam) and other industries (defense, food and beverage, industrial gases, pharmaceuticals, water)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Industries and applications" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which industries and applications the valve is intended for."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:flowserve-worcester-f51-f52:source:table_azure_5> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Standards of compliance of the valve: valve specification (FM approval, BS EN ISO 17292 and API 608, Pressure Equipment Directive 2014/68/EU, PER SI 2016, assessment category, SIL 3 capable, TSG, CRN, TR CU), face-to-face (BS EN 558-2 and ASME B16.10), flanged connections (BS EN 1759-1 and ASME B16.5 CL150/CL300), fugitive emissions (ISO 15848 Class BH, API 641), surface quality, fire test, pressure test and sour service standards."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Standards of compliance" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52.pdf" ;
